I don't play much on my laptop, but I did change the keyboard driver to 
make it easier to play without a separate keypad because I'm so used to the 
keyboard changes I did for the Psion. 

If you want I can send you a modified nhdefkey.dll [yes, I know I 
should rename it, but its just for my own use] keyboard dll (source or 
compiled as your prefer). Up/down/left and right arrow keys give N, S, E, W 
as usual, but in combination with the Alt key give NE, SW, SE, NW instead: 
i.e. rotated 45 degrees clockwise. shift+alt+direction also works as 
expected.

I also did something similar for NethackW.exe only there I used left-
control as the modifier since thats easier than using the Alt key under 
windows.


